          "Description": "This is an optional parameter. If it is set to True, the command resets one or more properties of a Work Order Operation and its Work Order Operation Extended, when the property has been modified to empty.\r\nIf the parameter is set to False, the command does not reset any property, even if it has been modified to empty. ",
