      "Description": "Creates a new Work Order specifying which Work Master should be used as basis for Operations, Parameters and Specifications.\r\nThe command may return the following error codes, during its execution:\r\n* Error -10300: The Order does not exist.\r\n* Error -10100: Generic Error.\r\n* Error -10952: The WorkOrderExtended entity has not been found for Work Order with the specified Id.\r\n* Error -10996: The Current revision of Operation has not been found.\r\n* Error -10957: There is no Operation that references the Operation with the specified NId.\r\n* Error -10956: There is no Operation that references the Operation with the specified NId and Revision.\r\n* Error -10983: The Work Order with the specified NId could not be created.",
      "ArtifactType": "Command",
