      "ReferencedFullInfo": "Siemens.SimaticIT.UAPI.OperationalData.PICore_OP.OPModel.Commands.UpdateWorkOrderOperationParameterRequirement",
      "Description": "Updates the Equipment for a Parameter Requirement of a Work Order Operation.\r\nThe command returns the respective error code by performing the following checks:\r\n10968: checks if the Equipment being associated with Parameter Requirement is a valid Equipment.\r\n10969: checks if parameters already exist with same Equipment association or without any association before saving the Equipment modifications.",
