      "FullInfo": "Siemens.SimaticIT.UAPI.PICore.PICore.PIPOMModel.Commands.AssociateManualProcessDefinitionsWithWorkOrderOperation",
      "ReferencedFullInfo": "Siemens.SimaticIT.UAPI.OperationalData.PICore_OP.OPModel.Commands.AssociateManualProcessDefinitionsWithWorkOrderOperation",
      "Description": "Associates a Work Order Operation to one or more Process Definitions.\r\n\r\nThe command may return the following error codes:\r\n* -10300: The Work Order Operation specified in input does not exist.\r\n* -10890: Two revisions of a Process Definition cannot be associated to the Work Order Operation.\r\n* -10889: One of the Process Definitions you are associating has no revision set to current. \r\n* -10811: A Process Definition with specified NId and Revision  does not exist.\r\n* -10892: A Process Definition could not be found.\r\n* -11349: The Process Definition with NId: {0} and Revision: {1} is not associated to the PIProcessDefinitionContext.",
      "ArtifactType": "Command",
      "NotSupportedBySignalRule": "True",
      "Members": [
