          "Description": "The list of Process Definitions for which the link to the Work Order Operation must be removed. Each Process Definition is identified by its natural identifier and revision.",
          "Type": "Siemens.SimaticIT.ReferenceData.UDM_RF.RFModel.Types.LinkToRevisonedEntity",
          "MemberArtifactType": "ParameterType",
          "IsCollection": "True",
